ce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634470/extras/1bb937ccb66a49786084a5784c66aeb2.mp4?t=1735684730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Simple and effective as it looks: A camera with a super flash ready to aim and shoot, enemies and your limited medicine to heal if you are surprised from behind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634470/extras/14b56f7da80b71e47a72ddfcf9827c42.poster.avif?t=1735684730\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634470/extras/14b56f7da80b71e47a72ddfcf9827c42.webm?t=1735684730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634470/extras/14b56f7da80b71e47a72ddfcf9827c42.mp4?t=1735684730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Castle</h2><br>Solve unique puzzles and explore the castle while surviving.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634470/extras/6ad9938f76804de3deff14f90b2cffcc.poster.avif?t=1735684730\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634470/extras/6ad9938f76804de3deff14f90b2cffcc.webm?t=1735684730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634470/extras/6ad9938f76804de3deff14f90b2cffcc.mp4?t=1735684730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Please note: This game is an experience that can be completed in under 2 hours and is aimed at players who enjoy old school survival horror games.",
